    "spec": "Change the customerCode format to '<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>' where CITY3 is the upper-cased first three letters of the city, LAST3 the first three of the lastName, and NNNN a per-city 4-digit sequence (one more than the owners already in that city). Every value derived from the customerCode, such as the membership number, must be rebuilt on the new format. This changes the current customerCode and everything built from it.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nChange the customerCode format to '<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>' where CITY3 is the upper-cased first three letters of the city, LAST3 the first three of the lastName, and NNNN a per-city 4-digit sequence (one more than the owners already in that city). Every value derived from the customerCode, such as the membership number, must be rebuilt on the new format. This changes the current customerCode and everything built from it.\n"
